(a) Mastery in Tactical/Technical Competence to apply AG core competencies and critical functions, HR enabling systems, MDMP, ADPs (1,3-0/4-0/5-0/6-0/6-22/7-0), ATP 4-1.1, FMs (1- 0/ 3-0/4-0/6-0/6-22/7-0) and unit training.
(b) Ability to plan, train, and execute at the tactical, operational, and strategic levels.
(c) Reasoning skills.
